  "entry": "code/dashboard/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Overlay the predicted plasma and effect-site curves of every published PK/PD model for a chosen anesthetic drug, virtual patient and dosing schedule. It greys out models whose derivation envelope the patient falls outside, measures how far the models disagree, and offers side panels for synergy, local anesthetics, volatiles, reversal agents, pediatric extrapolation and pharmacogenomics. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
